Creators of such content are free to distribute, license, or use their creations under any terms they choose, including for commercial purposes, as long as the original mod itself is not redistributed in violation of this license.

This clause does not grant permission to redistribute, modify, or commercialize the original mod code or assets beyond the scope of fair use or explicit permissions described above.

